Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:01:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(缅因州  大赦湾  1985年)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儒勒·凡尔纳曾经写道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jules Verne once wrote,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"把两艘船放在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Put two ships in the open sea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风平浪静的大海上  它们必会相遇"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without wind or tide, they will come together."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的父母就是这样相遇的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how my parents met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像两艘命中注定会相遇的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like two ships destined for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张  你刚才都没气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy. You weren't breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来自两个不同的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但人生就如大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But life, like the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们走到了一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a way of bringing people together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正打算给你煎鸡蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna make you some eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别把我的狗吃了  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't eat my dog, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你泡了茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  喝一口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝了会感觉好些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll make you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯女王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫汤姆  灯塔看守人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Tom. Keeper of lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她从一场包办婚姻中逃离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had fled an arranged marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抛下了她的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left her whole world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在我父亲的灯塔里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in my father's lighthouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她找寻到了意想不到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she found something unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我父亲找到了他的一生挚爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my father found the love of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四级飓风亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Category 4 Hurricane Arthur
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将在下午两点后登陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is due to make landfall sometime after 2:00 P.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫亚瑟怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about Arthur?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飓风的名字吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the hurricane?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是传奇亚瑟王的名字  他也是个王  不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After a legend. He's a king, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还不止如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我们两族能和平共处的证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's living proof our people can coexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天他会让我们的世界团结起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could unite our worlds one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有最强大的亚特兰蒂斯人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the trident could only be wielded
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能使用三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the strongest Atlantean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰王凭借它掌控了七大海洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it gave King Atlan mastery over the seven seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三叉戟使他变得如此强大  以至于海洋都嫉妒他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It made him so powerful that the ocean itself became jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发动了一场可怕的地震来摧毁亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent a terrible earthquake to destroy Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯陨落了  沉入了海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down it fell, to the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  传说有一天会有一个新的国王到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, legend has it that one day a new king will come
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将使用三叉戟的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who will use the power of the trident
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将亚特兰蒂斯重新联合起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put Atlantis back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰娜女王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen Atlanna,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧瓦克国王命令您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the authority of King Orvax,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.55,0:06:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻返回亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are ordered to return to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但亚特兰蒂斯从不忘却{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Atlantis' memory is long...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王不愿放她走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And its king refused to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亚特兰娜  - 汤姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Atlanna! -  Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的武器  - 接住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My weapon! -  Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的两个世界本就不该相遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their two worlds were never meant to meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我是一段本不该相爱的爱情的产物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I was a product of a love that never should've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必回去的  亚特兰娜  求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to do this, Atlanna. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他们总能找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. They will always find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一次  他们会派出一支大军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, they'll send an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须回去  只有这样才能救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go back. It is the only way to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的世界里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where I come from...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大海会带走我们的泪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sea carries our tears away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里你能感受到泪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you feel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等安全了  我就回来找你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will return to you. When it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有朝一日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里  日出之时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here, at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会再团聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要坚强  我的小王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay strong, my little prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远和你在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:09:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他忘了我  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him forget me. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的生命都从海中孕育{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All life came from the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们想要了解自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so if we want to understand ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就必须回到起点来看一看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must journey to where we began.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(马萨诸塞州  波士顿海洋馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而现在  比起我们地球的海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, today, we have better maps of Mars
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们更了解的是火星的地貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than we do of our own sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来  靠近点  快  小鱼鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, closer. Come on, fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快  快过来  - 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Come over here. -  Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别拍了  - 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop that. -  Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着大家一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见  小鱼  - 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, fishy. -  Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫亚瑟  你们叫什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Arthur. What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们饿了吗  我也饿了  - 瞧啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys hungry? Me, too. -  Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟在跟鱼讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur is talking to the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪胎一个  亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a freak, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 住手  - 那你要怎么办呢  怪胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop! -  What are you gonna do about it, freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《海王》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(时至今日)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走  快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.29,0:12:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头儿  我们控制了船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we've secured the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求救信号关掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Distress signal's disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人找得到我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running dark again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们已经知道了  你们逃不掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they heard it. You can count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你做个交易  我不教你怎么当船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make you a deal. I won't tell you how to Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也别教我怎么当海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't tell me how to pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他船员在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the rest of the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的勇气只有不做无谓的冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decided discretion was the better part of valor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并把自己锁在鱼雷舱里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sealed themselves up in the torpedo bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们名声在外啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our reputation precedes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.12,0:12:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你名声在外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不能收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't take that piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的挚爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the love of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没告诉过你它背后的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never told you the story behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你爷爷传给我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was your grandfather's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是第二次世界大战期间海军的第一批蛙人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was one of the Navy's first frogmen during World War II.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他非常擅长在水中隐蔽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was so stealthy in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部队里给他起了绰号叫魔鬼鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his unit nicknamed him Manta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是战后  他的国家把他忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But after the war, his country forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是他回到了海里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, he went back to the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他的智慧糊口求生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scavenging and surviving with his wit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带着这把刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像你这么大的时候  他把刀传给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave it to me when I was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在它是你的了  儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it's yours, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们撞到什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we just hit something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  是有东西撞了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Something hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头儿  外面有东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, there's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了一艘潜水艇吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我觉得是个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... No. I think it's a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能是人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A队  去右边  B队  检查通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha, to the right. Bravo team, sweep the passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以进来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Permission to come aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aquaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为了救你们可错过了不少欢乐时光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等你很久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've waited a long time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该认识你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I supposed to know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在公海上寻找猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I scavenge the high seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是海王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们注定会相见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were bound to meet at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不要经常见了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not make it a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不要脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.06,0:19:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们自找的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys got yourselves into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就自己出去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourselves out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我  他被压住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! He's trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能就这么丢下他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't leave him like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了无辜的人  向大海乞求怜悯去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed innocent people. You ask the sea for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(压载舱破裂)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  别管我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here! I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  我不会丢下你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, I'm not leaving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须活下去  才能杀了那个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to live, so you can kill that son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快走  - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, go! -  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走啊  - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! -  Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是知道在哪里能找到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always know where to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老习惯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.94,0:22:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧  我请你吃早餐  - 好咧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, I'll buy you breakfast. -  All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我让他们帮你把酒装到吸管杯里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to have them put that in a sippy cup for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我能在水下呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it that I can breathe underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.89,0:23:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在酒桌上却还是喝不过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can still drink me under the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的超能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my superpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一艘俄罗斯潜艇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Russian submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.73,0:23:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚被高科技海盗劫持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hijacked late last night by high-tech pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.97,0:23:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些海盗涉嫌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same pirates who are suspected
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:13.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与海军高度机密的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in connection with the disappearance of the Navy's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形潜艇原型的失踪有关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}highly classified prototype stealth submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.47,0:23:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现有未经证实的报道称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a further development, we now have unconfirmed reports
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.81,0:23:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这位被社交媒体戏称为"海王"的超能力者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the metahuman dubbed by social media as "the Aquaman"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.55,0:23:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行了此次大胆的营救行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was responsible for this daring rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡说八道  就是你  对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit. You're doing it, aren't you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像维科教导你的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Vulko trained you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你不可能永远袖手旁观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you couldn't stand on the sidelines forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.53,0:23:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈一直都知道你很特别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother always knew you were special.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even start.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她相信你能让我们的两个世界团结起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She believed you'd be the one to unite our two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管亚特兰蒂斯有什么问题  你都会不在话下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever Atlantis' problems are, you're bigger than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯害死了我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis murdered my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:23:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know that for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:23:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们杀了她  因为她爱你  因为她生下了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed her. For loving you and having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.92,0:24:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你心里明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子  总有一天你不能再怪罪你自己了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, one day you're gonna have to stop blaming yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是电视上那个鱼人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You that fish boy from the TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是鱼人  有何贵干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's "Fish man." What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.08,0:24:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你我想干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以和你合影吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could we get a picture with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我们这儿的英雄  兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like our local hero, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了  拍一张要不了多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would mean a lot. Just a quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.60,0:24:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.94,0:24:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  来拍吧  - 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. Let's do this. -  Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.54,0:25:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  很好  我们这样拍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, that's exactly right. I'm gonna go down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了  大家笑一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go. Everybody smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.84,0:25:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(大西洋某处)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他明白这次会面的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He understands the significance of this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.84,0:26:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会听你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll hear you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.95,0:26:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 奥姆王  - 涅柔斯国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- King Orm. -  King Nereus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挑的会面地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked a meeting place
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太接近陆地了  我不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too close to the surface for my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.59,0:26:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道这里是国王议会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't recognize the Council of the Kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰国王在位之时  七大王国是一体的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Atlan's time, when the Seven Kingdoms were one,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的祖先会聚集在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our ancestors gathered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯国王坐在桌首{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis sat here at the head of the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泽贝尔国王  像往常一样  坐在他旁边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xebel, as always, by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.94,0:26:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咸水族  鱼人族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brine. Fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.81,0:26:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候迷失国和海沟族还没有陨落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Deserters and the Trench had not yet fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.05,0:26:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失落国度还没有消亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lost Nation had not yet vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.15,0:26:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一起造就了世界上最伟大的帝国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, they were the greatest empire the world had ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.12,0:26:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在  我坐在亚特兰的宝座上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, I sit on Atlan's throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被陈旧的法律和政治束缚着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shackled by archaic laws and politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们头顶上威胁的增长却不可忽视...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While the threat above us grows undeniably...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.99,0:27:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陆地人总是充斥着暴力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violence has always plagued the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.10,0:27:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会毁了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will destroy themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.92,0:27:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会先毁了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not before destroying us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.37,0:27:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经躲藏得够久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been hiding long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.64,0:27:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯再次崛起的时刻已经到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come for Atlantis to rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们尊敬你  涅柔斯国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We honor you, King Nereus,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们邀请泽贝尔成为第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by inviting Xebel to be the first kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入奥姆王联盟的王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to join King Orm's alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好像还有别的选择一样  维科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if you had a choice, Vulko.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.55,0:27:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据法律  你必须征得四个王国的同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By law, you need four of the Seven Kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.72,0:27:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才能掌权并发动攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ascend and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.39,0:27:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失落国度和迷失国早已灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lost Nation and the Deserters have long perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.59,0:27:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海沟族只剩下怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Trench are nothing but animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咸水族永远不可能加入  而鱼人族都是懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brine will never join you, and the Fishermen are cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有我和我的军队去说服他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without me and my army to convince them,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.89,0:27:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的计划就会胎死腹中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your plans are stillborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道你真正的目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦你得到了四个王国的首肯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've obtained the pledge of the four kingdoms,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.67,0:27:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会成为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will be ordained
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.48,0:27:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海洋领主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ocean Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.21,0:27:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不过是一个头衔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is merely a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.21,0:27:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是傻子  奥姆王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no fool, King Orm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为海洋领主  你就能指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Ocean Master, you'll be commander
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.68,0:27:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球上最强大的军事力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the greatest military might on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.49,0:28:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是天选的领导者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the natural choice to lead it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.73,0:28:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有传言说还有一位天选之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the rumors that there's another?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个亚特兰蒂斯人  生活在陆地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Atlantean, living among the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是皇室的血脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of royal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.43,0:28:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以坐在亚特兰蒂斯的王座上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may sit on the throne of Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你王座摇摇欲坠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your claim to it is weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.34,0:28:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可能还想着要统一整个帝国呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you possibly hope to unite the empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.47,0:28:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我母亲的野种甚至没来过亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother's bastard has never even been to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.81,0:28:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他忠于陆地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His loyalty is to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.82,0:28:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是陆地人  拿起武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surface-dwellers! To arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:29:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的国王受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your king is injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.94,0:30:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是想发动战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to start a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.88,0:30:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争早就已经开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.61,0:30:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候让他们听听们要说的话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's time we send them a message they'll hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.55,0:30:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事  - 别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm good. -  Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给你钥匙  - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here're the keys. -  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家给你纹面吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home and work on your ta moko. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.12,0:30:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你祖父还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your grandpops was still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.63,0:30:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见你没做完纹面  肯定会狠狠打我们的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'd be banging our heads for not finishing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  但我们有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he would, but there is plenty of time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.47,0:30:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先送你回去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get you to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.57,0:30:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.95,0:30:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你跟我回亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to come with me to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.65,0:30:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要告诉你的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm gonna tell you the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.48,0:30:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经跟那老海星维科说过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I told that rusty starfish Vulko.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.49,0:30:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过对你客气点  因为尊重女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except nicer, because you're a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.52,0:30:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  谢谢  我没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you. I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.52,0:30:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打败了荒原狼  拯救了亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You defeated Steppenwolf and saved Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.69,0:30:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那跟亚特兰蒂斯一点关系都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That had nothing to do with Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.56,0:30:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你同母异父的兄弟奥姆王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your half-brother King Orm is about to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.05,0:31:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要发动对陆地世界的战争了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}declare war upon the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数十亿的人将会丧生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billions will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.14,0:31:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我的族群都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your people and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.37,0:31:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你建议我们怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you propose we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.71,0:31:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是亚特兰娜女王的长子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the firstborn son of Queen Atlanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王位是你与生俱来的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The throne is yours by birthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止这场战争  拯救两个世界的唯一方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to stop this war and save both worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.99,0:31:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是让你获得你应有的国王地位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is for you to take your rightful place as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得只要我一出现  奥姆就会放弃王位吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think if I just show up, Orm's gonna give up the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.92,0:31:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是被你们处决的女王的私生子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the bastard son of the queen your people executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.97,0:31:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我  我不是什么国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. I am no king.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.60,0:31:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那太好了  很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's awesome. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.87,0:31:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  不知为何维科很信任你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Vulko seems to believe in you for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.48,0:31:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科已经找到了亚特兰失落三叉戟的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko has learned of the location of the Lost Trident of Atlan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.38,0:31:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童话故事  那只是个传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, fairy tales. It's a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.45,0:31:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.99,0:31:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了神圣的三叉戟  人们就会服从你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the Sacred Trident, the people will listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.09,0:31:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就可以获得你与生俱来的权利  废黜奥姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can then claim your birthright and dethrone Orm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.39,0:32:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我与生俱来的权利已经和我母亲一同死去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My birthright? It died with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.26,0:32:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可以向你保证  要是奥姆发动攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I promise you this. If Orm attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会用你们对待我母亲的方式对待他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will treat him exactly the same way your people treated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.17,0:32:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不留情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.17,0:32:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(北海某处)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.06,0:33:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘潜艇几乎已经废了  但它完成了它的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That submarine was barely operational, but it served its purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.67,0:33:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的一个族人阻碍了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of your kind intervened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.43,0:33:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是我们的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.50,0:33:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.18,0:33:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的交易已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our transaction has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.31,0:33:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要钱  我要海王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the money. I want Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.72,0:34:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.19,0:34:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.43,0:35:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.20,0:35:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  他没有呼吸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! He's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.27,0:35:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开  我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.12,0:35:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.03,0:36:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒一醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.51,0:36:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不知道你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.81,0:36:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是泽贝尔公主媚拉·查拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Princess Y'Mera Xebella Challa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以叫我媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may call me Mera.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.35,0:36:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mera.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.04,0:36:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.21,0:36:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奥姆干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was Orm's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.65,0:36:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最坏的还没来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.16,0:37:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经设立了暴洪预警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a flash flood warning here
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.99,0:37:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间延长了几小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was just extended for a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.70,0:37:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天在世界各地出现了前所未有的景象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unprecedented sights from all over the world today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们看到战舰和垃圾被巨浪冲上岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are seeing warships and trash washed up by massive waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.97,0:37:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海岸线上充斥着废物和垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These extraordinary scenes of coastlines deluged with waste
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.31,0:37:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不同寻常的场景正在世界各地上演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and garbage are taking place all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.81,0:37:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几十年间产生的污染又重新回到了陆地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decades of pollution has been thrown back onto land.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多人都在问这样一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many are asking the question,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.91,0:37:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自然灾害还是另有缘由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Was this a natural disaster or something else?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.28,0:37:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这不是自然灾害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This was no natural disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.88,0:37:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他们把我们的垃圾和战舰扔了出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They threw out our garbage and our warships.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.22,0:37:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们与亚特兰蒂斯人民的首次接触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was our first contact with the people of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.62,0:37:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又开始讲你那疯疯癫癫的亚特兰蒂斯理论了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go again with your insane Atlantean theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.93,0:37:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全没有任何证据  沈博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have absolutely no proof, Dr. Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.83,0:37:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.26,0:37:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有一个亚特兰蒂斯人生活在我们中间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We already have an Atlantean living among us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.83,0:37:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的名字叫海王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his name is Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.14,0:37:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.87,0:37:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科就是在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the exact spot
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.28,0:37:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我上了第一堂游泳课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Vulko gave me my first swimming lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.08,0:37:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须把陆地上学到的一切忘掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to forget all the teaching of the surface world
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更深入地挖掘你亚特兰蒂斯人的本能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and go deeper to uncover your Atlantean instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.19,0:38:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我已经知道怎么游泳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I already know how to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.46,0:38:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还远远不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.46,0:38:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先说清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so we're clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.70,0:38:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你阻止战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you stop this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.33,0:38:17.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就到此为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.83,0:38:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许那样最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.09,0:38:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海洋不仅仅是我们的生命之源  亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ocean is more than our life source, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.39,0:38:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海洋就是我们本身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.79,0:38:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着  你可以在水下说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you can talk underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.89,0:38:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也可以在水下说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can talk underwater, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.40,0:38:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.67,0:38:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能做的可不止是说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we can do more than just talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.64,0:39:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为亚特兰蒂斯人不仅仅意味着你能在水里呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being Atlantean means more than just being able to breathe water.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.78,0:39:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身体能够承受极端的寒冷和压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your body is equipped to survive the extreme cold and pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.79,0:39:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼睛能够适应黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your eyes adjust to see in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.28,0:39:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.31,0:40:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科  我什么时候能见我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Vulko, when can I meet my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.01,0:40:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快  小王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, my young prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.35,0:40:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你准备好了  我带你去亚特兰蒂斯见王后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're ready, I'll take you to Atlantis to meet the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.03,0:40:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把我的船藏在了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hid my ship in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.57,0:40:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我才不要上这破船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm not getting in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.40,0:40:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想去到我们的目的地  你就必须上船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to get where we're going, you're gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.34,0:40:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的渔船在一直泡在三文鱼油里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fish ship has been marinating in chum butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.51,0:40:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下船的时候肯定全身都是沼泽的臭味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna come out smelling like swamp butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.51,0:40:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在比那还臭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(亚特兰蒂斯王国)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.58,0:41:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在水下建一座桥有什么意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the point in having a bridge underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.68,0:41:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门桥是旧世界的遗迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Gateway Bridge is a remnant of the Old World.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.08,0:41:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是进出首府的唯一路径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's also the only way in or out of the Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.09,0:41:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不直接翻墙过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't they just go over the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.62,0:42:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防卫牢不可破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security is impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.26,0:42:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使他们成功躲过了守卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if they did manage to evade the guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.99,0:42:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不可能躲过水加农炮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'd never get past the hydro-cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.06,0:42:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们总是想偷偷溜进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People try to sneak in all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.43,0:42:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.88,0:42:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.15,0:42:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海关及边境管制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Customs and border control.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.59,0:42:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  我有外交通行证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I have diplomatic clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.47,0:42:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.12,0:43:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧城里有安全屋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a safe house down in the Old City.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.38,0:43:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血统高贵的族人从不下到海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Highborns never venture to the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.65,0:43:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.59,0:44:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个气穴是额外的预防措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We use this air pocket as an extra layer of precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有血统高贵的族人才能在水中自由呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the Highborns can breathe water as well as air.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.49,0:44:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还能把动物们挡在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, it keeps the animals out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.13,0:44:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们会弄得很乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They get kind of messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.80,0:44:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科  我来了  老伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko. Here I am, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多年了  你终于得到你想要的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years, you finally get what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.37,0:44:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟  真希望不是在这种情况下和你重逢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, I wish it was under better circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.21,0:44:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信奥姆竟然袭击了陆地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe Orm attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.54,0:44:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还不是袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.48,0:44:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照律法  他现在还不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legally, he's not allowed to yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.82,0:44:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他破坏你们的陆地战舰是一个警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What he did to your surface warships was merely a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.25,0:44:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What provoked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.79,0:44:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥姆国王和你的父亲被陆地人埋伏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Orm and your father were ambushed by the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.42,0:44:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被陆地人  我可不觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the surface? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.06,0:44:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们现在还以为亚特兰蒂斯只是一个神话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They still think Atlantis is a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.99,0:44:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.70,0:44:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一艘陆地军舰朝我们开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A surface warship fired at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.57,0:45:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在泽贝尔和亚特兰蒂斯结盟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Xebel sides with Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.30,0:45:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加强了奥姆手中的兵力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving Orm a fleet big enough
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.25,0:45:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他能够强迫其他两个王国加入他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to force the other two kingdoms to join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.21,0:45:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们要阻止这场战争  你必须推翻他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're going to prevent this war, you must dethrone him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.78,0:45:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和你说多少遍  我不想做国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times do I have to tell you? I don't wanna be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.05,0:45:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他成为海洋领主  那就太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once he is named Ocean Master, it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.32,0:45:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power at his disposal
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.69,0:45:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会是你无法想象的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be unlike anything you have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从陆地上来的  没人会把我放在眼里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from the surface. No one is gonna take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.73,0:45:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道该从哪里开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? I don't even know where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.29,0:45:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先从证明你自己值得拥戴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By winning the hearts and minds of the people
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.76,0:45:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取回这个  赢得人心和民意开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by proving to them that you're worthy, and retrieving this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经有一个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already got one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.04,0:45:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不一样  你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like this one, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.31,0:45:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是亚特兰失落三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Lost Trident of Atlan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.98,0:45:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这个传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.22,0:45:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不仅仅是个传说  这是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more than a story. It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.72,0:45:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是有史以来最伟大的武器锻造师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was forged by the greatest weapon masters in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.76,0:46:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用波塞冬寒铁  为亚特兰蒂斯首位统治者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crafted from Poseidon's steel for King Atlan,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.33,0:46:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰王所铸造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first ruler of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.53,0:46:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说这柄三叉戟中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legend says the trident
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.97,0:46:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注入了能统治海洋的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was imbued with the power to command the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.14,0:46:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后这柄三叉戟怎么样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.97,0:46:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这要追溯到一切陨落之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To know that is to go back to the time before the Great Fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.58,0:46:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候亚特兰王还是统治者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when King Atlan ruled over all that was,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.81,0:46:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯也还只有一个王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the kingdoms of Atlantis were one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.02,0:46:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候科技进步  国家繁荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a time of great prosperity and technological advancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.53,0:46:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在世界的其他角落还以为地球是平的时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had unlocked the secret of unlimited energy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.16,0:46:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经发掘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a time when the rest of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.90,0:46:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无限能源的奥秘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}still thought the earth was flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.10,0:46:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们的野心膨胀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we became too ambitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对权力愈加渴求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too hungry for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.19,0:47:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海洋吞噬了我们  亚特兰蒂斯沉没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ocean swallowed us, and Atlantis sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.26,0:47:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是让我们的文明崩塌的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the very power that collapsed our civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.20,0:47:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也为我们开拓了通往未来的大道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}also paved the way to our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.50,0:47:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被赋予了能在水下呼吸的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gave us the ability to breathe underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.40,0:47:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是  我们进化了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, we evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.41,0:47:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退化的人则变成了野鱼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others regressed, became savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王则在自我放逐中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the king lived out the remainder of his days
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.99,0:47:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过完了余生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in self-imposed exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也没有人见过他和那柄三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither he nor the trident were ever seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.09,0:47:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有一支考古小队几个月前发现了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of our archeological teams uncovered this a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.36,0:47:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一则能追溯到第一代王朝的古记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an ancient recording dating back to the First Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.23,0:47:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信这里面有亚特兰王给人民留下的最后的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it contains Atlan's final message to his people
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.97,0:47:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及神圣三叉戟的所在之处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the whereabouts of the Sacred Trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.47,0:47:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道  这所使用的科技太古老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know. The technology's too old.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.24,0:48:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根管子上有迷失国的标志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cylinder bears the markings of the Deserter Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.01,0:48:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得带到那里  得到信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must take it there and retrieve the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.81,0:48:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰王安息之处的线索就藏在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clue to Atlan's final resting place is inside of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.03,0:48:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,边境护卫队  你因非法入侵而被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Border Defense. You are under arrest for illegal entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.20,0:48:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.11,0:48:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能被人看到你在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mustn't be seen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.83,0:49:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定不想好好聊聊吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you want to talk about this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.97,0:49:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.88,0:50:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以国王奥姆陛下之名宣布  你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of His Highness, King Orm, I place you under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.44,0:50:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Atlantis...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.31,0:50:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.78,0:50:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信  你终于来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.92,0:50:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听了太多关于你的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard so many stories about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.53,0:51:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多年来  我一直以我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these years, I've been ashamed of my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.73,0:51:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,委身于一个陆地人而为辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for defiling herself with a surface-dweller.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.87,0:51:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以我有一个混血的哥哥为辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashamed of the fact that I have a half-breed brother
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.94,0:51:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我多想用我的三叉戟戳穿你的心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose heart I wanted to run my trident through.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.87,0:51:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你现在终于来到了我的面前  我承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now that you're finally here before me, I must admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.09,0:51:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很矛盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am conflicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.59,0:51:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要冲突吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.89,0:51:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如解开我的链子  弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why don't you take these chains off, little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.56,0:51:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就知道谁能笑到最后了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll see who gets run through.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.86,0:51:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你带来了我们母亲的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I see you've brought our mother's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.87,0:51:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去了这么久  你就是为此而来的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that why you've come here after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.57,0:51:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.17,0:51:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来组织一个疯子毁灭世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to stop a maniac from destroying the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.98,0:51:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.91,0:51:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么阻止陆地人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you plan to stop the atrocities
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.75,0:52:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来的暴行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the surface continues to commit?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.68,0:52:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这一个世纪以来  他们污染我们的水域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because for a century, they have polluted our waters
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毒害我们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and poisoned our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.79,0:52:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  他们烧红了天空  大洋也为之沸腾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, their skies burn and our oceans boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.46,0:52:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你花了这么大的力气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've come all this way
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.18,0:52:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是为了站在你族人的对立面吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take sides against your own people?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.07,0:52:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种战争根本没有什么站边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no sides in a war like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.24,0:52:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你显然已经选择了自己的站边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have clearly chosen a side
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.95,0:52:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这里妄图挑战王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and come here to challenge the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.97,0:52:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果只有那样才能阻止你的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what it takes to stop your war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.08,0:52:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要发起国王挑战吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you invoking the Combat of the Kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.95,0:52:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么说  我看就是打你屁股{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it whatever you want. I call it an ass-whooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.25,0:52:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们不如就这么办吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then, perhaps that's how we'll proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.79,0:52:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 陛下  - 奥姆  别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your Majesty! -  Orm, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.55,0:52:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还不明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.96,0:52:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我在所有人的见证下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I defeat the firstborn son of Atlanna
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.99,0:52:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在正式挑战中打败了亚特兰娜的长子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a formal challenge in front of everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.46,0:52:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那七大王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then all Seven Kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.21,0:52:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就必须承认我是真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will have to concede that I am the one true king.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.56,0:52:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下  击败无知者没有胜利可言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty, there is no victory in defeating the ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.57,0:52:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哥哥显然是个低能儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother is clearly an imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:52:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下  他不懂我们的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Highness, he doesn't know our ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.11,0:53:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他就要被好好教育一番{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he's about to get an education.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.78,0:53:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要正式挑战我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you officially challenging me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.75,0:53:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我要挑战你  等我赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell yes, I challenge you. And when I win...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.95,0:53:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you win,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.48,0:53:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将停止一切举动  战争结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will cease all immediate action. The war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.06,0:53:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果我赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I win...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.39,0:53:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.36,0:53:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.89,0:53:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.53,0:53:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战已经提出  我接受了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Challenge has been made, and I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.57,0:53:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他准备好上烈焰之环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare him for the Ring of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.04,0:53:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  什么环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. The ring of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.36,0:53:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能如此愚蠢地被奥姆下套进行战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you be so foolish to let Orm bait you into a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.23,0:53:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得我解决了我们的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to me like I just solved all of our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.93,0:53:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打赢他  战争就结束了  我就能回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beat him in a battle, war's over, I get to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.23,0:53:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在陆地上是一名优秀的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a formidable fighter on land,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.47,0:54:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你在这里根本无法发挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but here you're out of your element, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.00,0:54:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥姆一直都在水下生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orm has spent his entire life underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.81,0:54:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行作战训练  进行精英训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}training to be a warrior, training to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.51,0:54:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你教会了我怎么战斗  眼镜蛇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught me how to fight, Cobra Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.68,0:54:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你还记不记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if you remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.55,0:54:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这大叉子是用来干什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's with the big fork?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.92,0:54:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是三叉戟  防住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trident. Now, defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.76,0:54:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你能熟练掌握三叉戟的用法  我会教你这一招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll teach you this move when you've mastered the trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.24,0:55:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.74,0:55:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西又大又笨重  我为什么不能用剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing is so big and awkward. Why can't I use a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.81,0:55:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你妈妈的三叉戟  皇家传统武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your mother's trident. A traditional weapon of royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.58,0:55:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能熟练掌握  你才能成为国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never be a king until you've mastered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.18,0:55:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那她为什么从来不来看我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why has she never come to see me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.85,0:55:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  等你准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, when you're ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.98,0:55:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再骗我了  我做了你要我做到的所有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop lying to me! I've done everything you ever asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.09,0:55:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每次通过一关  你就会给我另一关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time I pass a test, you make up another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.92,0:55:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么时候才能变得足够好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When am I gonna be good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.26,0:55:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不爱我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does she not love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.13,0:55:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈爱你甚于这世上的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother loved you more than anything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.37,0:55:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是她必须要回到亚特兰蒂斯  才能保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she had to return to Atlantis to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.21,0:55:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和欧瓦克国王的亲事很早以前就定了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her marriage to King Orvax was arranged a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.58,0:55:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以她必须要嫁给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she had to marry him...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.28,0:55:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他生下一子  奥姆王子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bear him a son, Prince Orm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.75,0:55:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当欧瓦克发现了你的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Orvax eventually found out about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.08,0:55:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被嫉妒所吞噬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he became overwhelmed with jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.65,0:56:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将她献祭给了海沟族的海怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sacrificed her to the creatures of the Trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.06,0:56:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说他们处决了她吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying they executed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.86,0:56:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她生下了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she had me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.81,0:56:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.65,0:56:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.45,0:56:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.36,0:56:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这原本是我母亲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It belonged to my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.09,0:56:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.30,0:56:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得她会希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think she would have enjoyed
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到自己的儿子们互相残杀吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching her sons murder each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.03,0:56:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白你的恐惧和抗拒  媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand your fear and your reluctance, Mera.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.57,0:56:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  我不想要战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I truly do. I don't want war...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.91,0:56:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想安抚我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't patronize me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.31,0:56:57.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.78,0:56:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所做的一切都违背了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're doing flies in the face of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.48,0:57:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们年少时  你母亲教导我们的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your mother taught us when we were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.45,0:57:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.55,0:57:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她不在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's not here, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.52,0:57:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的母亲教会我们叛变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What my mother taught us was treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.99,0:57:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要追随她的脚步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't follow in her wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.79,0:57:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  这是一个又大又古老的火焰环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! So, this is the big, old ring of fire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.73,0:57:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么玩  我就在这里暴揍你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it work? I just kick your ass right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.47,0:57:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.87,0:57:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请护送我的未婚妻去皇家座席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you escort my betrothed to the royal box?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.29,0:57:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  梅拉公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Lady Mera.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.63,0:57:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这里有一个关于卡拉森的神话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here, we have a legend about the Karathen,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.66,0:57:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一种强大的海怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an ancient sea monster so powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.09,0:57:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连亚特兰王也要惧上三分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that even King Atlan himself feared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.57,0:57:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是他将它关在海洋的深处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, he imprisoned it in the depths of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.97,0:58:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个怪兽就在深渊中等待着东山再起的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in that abyss, the creature bides its time waiting to rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.68,0:58:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯一直在等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis has been lying in wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.31,0:58:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  这怪兽苏醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the beast has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经  我无比地想要见上你一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know here was a time when I wanted to meet you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.26,0:58:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想认识我的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to know my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.46,0:58:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他知道他不是一个人  我们有彼此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him know that he wasn't alone, that we were in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.61,0:58:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我知道你会变成这样一个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only I had known what a dick you would turn out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.34,0:58:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的母亲是因为你才被处决的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the reason our mother was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.32,0:58:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那以后我就一直恨你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've hated you for it ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不想杀死你  亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do not want to kill you, Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.89,0:58:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要再给你一次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to give you one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.79,0:58:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.16,0:59:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再回到亚特兰蒂斯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not ever come back to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你赢不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not going to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.54,0:59:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你愿不愿意  我们必要和陆地人开战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A war is coming to the surface whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.34,0:59:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要带着七大海的愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am bringing the wrath of the seven seas with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.11,0:59:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我不会放任不管的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.99,0:59:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.56,0:59:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烈焰之环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.61,0:59:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.12,0:59:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯的人民  听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People of Atlantis, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.75,0:59:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来自陆地的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother has come from the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.22,0:59:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要来挑战我的王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to challenge me for the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.36,1:00:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们用古老的办法解决他的挑衅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us settle his claim in the ancient way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.59,1:00:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浴血方能明神意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By bloodshed do the gods make known their will!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.57,1:00:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.74,1:00:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.84,1:00:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.84,1:00:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.35,1:00:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远成不了国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never be king!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.13,1:00:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我能看到我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never thought I'd see the day when my own father
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.90,1:00:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在亚特兰蒂斯国王面前低头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would bow before the king of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.74,1:00:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陆地人先出手的  你指望我们怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The surface-dwellers drew first blood. What would you have us do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.77,1:00:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求他们饶我们一命吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg them for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.24,1:00:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你一样讨厌陆地人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I detest the surface as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.61,1:00:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不觉得这一切发生的时机有点太凑巧了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't you find the timing of all of this a bit convenient?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.32,1:01:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你没有那么好骗  对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you wouldn't be that gullible, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.89,1:01:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想要发动这场战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want this war too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.83,1:01:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些陆地人已经不安于待在地面上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is past time the surface-dwellers learned their place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.43,1:01:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果必须要这么做的话  那只能放手去做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is how it must be done, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有我们母亲的三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have our mother's trident.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.41,1:01:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很强大  但是和她一样残缺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Powerful, but flawed like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.64,1:01:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我继承了我父亲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wield my father's.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.28,1:01:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这柄戟还未尝一败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it has never known defeat!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.63,1:02:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向亚特兰娜保证过我会保护她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised Atlanna I'd protect him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.41,1:02:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是比赛  这是处决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a competition. It's an execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.79,1:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是唯一真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the one true king!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.14,1:05:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在等我要请你吗  快进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You waiting for an invitation? Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.99,1:05:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.32,1:05:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我们有什么计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.06,1:05:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划就是找回亚特兰的三叉戟  然后挑战奥姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plan was to recover Atlan's trident, then challenge Orm.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.20,1:05:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那我们的顺序有点反了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so we're doing things a little out of order.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.93,1:05:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外总会有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.50,1:05:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  六点钟方向有飞行物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up! We got a bogey on our six!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.44,1:05:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这话是什么意思  - 后面有坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does that even mean? -  Bad guys behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.71,1:05:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就直接这么说就行了  - 后面有坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then just say that! -  Bad guys behind us!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.01,1:07:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你说过我们不能翻过这些墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, wait, you said we couldn't go over these walls.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.08,1:07:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 你说有水加农炮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I did! -  You said there were hydro-cannons!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.08,1:07:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did, now shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.69,1:07:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.68,1:07:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.05,1:07:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.78,1:07:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没死  但我希望他以为我们死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dead yet! But I'm hoping he'll think we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.00,1:07:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓着这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.33,1:07:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.73,1:07:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着  匹诺曹就是这样得救的  - 谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, it worked for Pinocchio. -  Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.57,1:08:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没谁  过来  进去  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind. Come here, get in. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.34,1:08:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  现在我们要被吃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. So we're getting eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.00,1:08:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么做到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you even doing this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.23,1:08:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.00,1:08:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有时能懂它们说话  它们有时也能懂我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear them sometimes, and they can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.57,1:08:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  因为你们都是又大又蠢的动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Because you're both big, dumb animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.44,1:08:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我刚救了你的命呢  - 我先救你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, I just saved your life. -  I saved yours first!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.48,1:08:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它说"没有危险了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said, "Coast is clear."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.48,1:08:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们现在去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where to now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.85,1:08:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去一片被你们称作撒哈拉的沙漠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the ocean of sand your people call the Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.42,1:08:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.33,1:09:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(西撒哈拉)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.51,1:09:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一般不接受包租{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't usually take charters,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.12,1:09:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一般也不会有人付我海盗宝藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't usually get paid in pirate treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.65,1:09:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你载我们  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the ride, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.92,1:09:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.89,1:09:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.66,1:09:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有到过这么高的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been so high up before.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.60,1:09:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者离家这么远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or so far from home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.60,1:09:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但至少你还有家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at least you have a home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.27,1:09:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.80,1:09:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can never go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.50,1:09:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我从竞技场里把你救下  我就背叛了一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I betrayed everything when I saved you from the coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.38,1:09:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你和国王订婚了  他们必须接纳你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but you're engaged to the king. They have to take you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.65,1:09:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯有很多优点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis is many wonderful things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.82,1:09:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不包括宽恕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But forgiving, it is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.72,1:10:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  但你是皇室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but you're royalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.05,1:10:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你母亲也曾经是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.36,1:10:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我现在回去  我就会被献祭给海沟族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I went back now, I'd be sacrificed to the Trench.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.23,1:10:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连我的父亲都不会接纳我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even my own father wouldn't take me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.47,1:10:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往好处看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look on the bright side,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.40,1:10:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你不用嫁给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now you don't have to marry
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.28,1:10:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某个你根本就不爱的混蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some tool bag that you're not in love with.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的责任不是爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My obligation isn't to love.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.87,1:10:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是要为我的家庭和国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is to my family and my nation,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.44,1:10:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我背弃了这两者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've turned my back on both.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.81,1:10:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候  你不得不做出正确的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, you have to do what's right,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.58,1:10:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便你会因此心痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if your heart aches against it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.34,1:10:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.74,1:10:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪器显示媚拉公主在迷失国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tracker places Princess Mera here, in the Deserter Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.48,1:10:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说她死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.51,1:11:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.42,1:11:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那说明你哥哥也还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your brother still lives as well?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活不了太久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.52,1:11:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穆克队长  马上集结先锋队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Murk, assemble a strike force immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.52,1:11:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  必须逮捕媚拉并安全送到我手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Mera is to be arrested and safely returned to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.26,1:11:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她背叛了王权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She betrayed the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.43,1:11:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是泽贝尔的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is a daughter of Xebel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.83,1:11:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她受到任何伤害  我们的联盟也就此终了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any harm befalls her, our coalition is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.80,1:11:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.37,1:11:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在进入鱼人国的水域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are now entering the waters of the Fishermen Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.77,1:11:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在首要考虑的应该是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Securing the alliance of the other two kingdoms
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.87,1:11:29.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维护和另外两国的联盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should be our immediate concern.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.11,1:11:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的宰相一如既往地正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My vizier is correct. As usual.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.09,1:11:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕他们  将涅柔斯国王的女儿毫发无伤地带回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest them and bring back King Nereus' daughter unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.48,1:12:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.65,1:12:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近有东西吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything nearby?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.19,1:12:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有延绵好几公里的沙漠  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but desert for hundreds of K's, mate!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有沙漠  - 他错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing but desert. -  He's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.33,1:12:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么  等等  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What are you doing? Wait! No! Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.10,1:12:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跳了下去  她都没有降落伞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just jumped! She didn't have a parachute!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.97,1:12:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红发疯子  不得不爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Redheads! You gotta love 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.62,1:12:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.90,1:13:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我以为的还要疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're crazier than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.24,1:13:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.84,1:13:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(印度洋某处)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.79,1:13:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次被打败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were defeated the last time
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.60,1:13:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为你的陆地武器不够强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because your surface weapons failed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.33,1:13:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ours will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.87,1:13:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是下一代亚特兰蒂斯士兵盔甲的原型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's prototype armor for the next generation Atlantean soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.27,1:13:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们亚特兰蒂斯人最是理解复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revenge is something we Atlanteans understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.46,1:13:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的精锐先锋队将听从你的指挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will lead my finest commandos as your personal army
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.38,1:13:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到那个混血杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to hunt down the half-breed abomination.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.36,1:13:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我动不了他们  但你可以  他逃到了你们的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot touch them, but you can. He's fled to your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.45,1:13:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他和跟他一起的那个女人  我会给你报酬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him and the woman he's with, and you will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.17,1:13:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死他就是我的报酬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing him is my reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.69,1:14:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,权杖  还处于实验开发阶段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crown jewel. Still experimental.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.63,1:14:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能将水转化成带电等离子束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Converts water into beams of energized plasma.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.27,1:15:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我需要更大的头盔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm gonna need a bigger helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.78,1:15:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初  这里还是一片内陆海时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the tribes of Atlantis broke off and settled here
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.38,1:15:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一支亚特兰蒂斯部族逃到了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when this region was still an inland sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.55,1:15:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当这里的水都干了  他们也随之消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the water dried up, they perished along with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.38,1:15:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了  真是太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perished? Yeah, that's terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.12,1:15:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们越来越接近了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting close now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.35,1:15:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  接近什么  快渴死了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? Close to what? Dying of thirst?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.82,1:15:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快要被当脸揍上一拳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close to getting punched in the face!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.79,1:15:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  疯子  我知道你还不知道这儿的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Fight Club, I know you're new to how things work up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.59,1:15:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如你看看周围  我们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you look around? We are lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.90,1:15:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那边  那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that over there? Hey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.50,1:15:48.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有  这里就是一片荒芜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nada. This place is a wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.27,1:15:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你把这一片荒芜当作家园的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one who calls this wasteland a home.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.77,1:15:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't my home!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.40,1:15:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有的陆地都长这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like the whole surface looks like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.24,1:15:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.17,1:15:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还有各种恶心的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've also got disgusting cities
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.41,1:15:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把废水都排到我们海洋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose sewers empty out into our ocean
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.41,1:16:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一堆堆的垃圾山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whole mountains made out of trash.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.31,1:16:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还有一堆大公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, oh, you've got great factories
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.01,1:16:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只会喷废料  融冰山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that do nothing but belch out filth and melt ice caps.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.92,1:16:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  知道了  听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Point taken. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.98,1:16:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的确有不少蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we got some idiots running the show,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.45,1:16:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们也有好的方面  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we've got some good things too, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.46,1:16:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有绿色的森林  高大的山丘和美丽的湖泊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got green forests and big mountains and beautiful lakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.72,1:16:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定会喜欢的  那就像是海洋宝宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd love 'em. They're like little baby oceans.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.56,1:16:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想激怒我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you trying to provoke me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是说你不能看都不看就对一个地方下定论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying you cannot judge a place before you've even seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.10,1:16:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你反正也对亚特兰蒂斯下定论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've judged Atlantis on far less.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.34,1:16:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你能不能停一下  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Would you just stop it with that? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.22,1:16:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那愚蠢的亚特兰蒂斯定位器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your stupid Atlantean GPS
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.85,1:16:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们从飞机上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just told you to jump out of an airplane
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.48,1:16:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳到沙漠中央  现在我们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the middle of the desert, and now we are stranded.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.75,1:16:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真的是下一任真正的国王  我们就完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're the next true king, we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.71,1:17:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(迷失国)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.71,1:17:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太刺激了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.22,1:17:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我找到了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Look what I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.06,1:17:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you found?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.36,1:17:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.77,1:17:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this place out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.07,1:17:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太厉害了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is badass!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.28,1:17:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是军械大厅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Hall of Armory.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.74,1:17:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是传说中亚特兰的三叉戟铸造的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the legends say Atlan's trident was forged.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.45,1:17:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不再觉得那是传说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think they're legends anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.82,1:17:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.79,1:17:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.33,1:18:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.30,1:18:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不会有用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.67,1:18:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从撒哈拉变成沙漠后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been sitting here collecting dust
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.63,1:18:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就一直在积灰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since before the Sahara was a desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.88,1:18:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.64,1:18:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"自从撒哈拉变成沙漠后"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Since before the Sahara was a desert."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你重复了我说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for repeating what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.85,1:18:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里都干了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's completely dried out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.65,1:18:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能说你什么都不想的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say you do your best thinking
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.22,1:19:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是你最机智的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you're not thinking at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.22,1:19:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  站着别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, now hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.29,1:19:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.56,1:19:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要水  你是最近的水源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need water, and you're the closest source.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.70,1:19:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.50,1:19:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞎显摆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.50,1:19:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也可以尿点尿到上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have just peed on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.58,1:20:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Atlan.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.75,1:20:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把三叉戟蕴藏着亚特兰蒂斯的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this trident resides the power of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.89,1:20:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果落入坏人之手  它将带来毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the wrong hands, it would bring destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.80,1:20:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果到了真正的继承者手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in the hands of the true heir,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.06,1:20:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它将联合海陆所有王国的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would unite all our kingdoms above and below.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.17,1:20:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果想得到我的力量  你必须证明你的价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you seek my power, you must prove your worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.11,1:20:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前往世界尽头之外的暗海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Journey beyond the edge of the world to the Hidden Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.64,1:20:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从瓶子里寻找航海路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look inside the bottle for the charted path.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.91,1:20:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在真正的国王手中  才能真正看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in the hands of the true king can he truly see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.03,1:20:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能让奥姆找到这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't let Orm find this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.67,1:20:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.94,1:20:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.48,1:21:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不应该先写下来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't we have written it down first?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.28,1:21:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经记住了  你没记住吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I memorized it. Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.98,1:21:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  当然记住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Totally.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.12,1:21:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd he just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.25,1:21:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"什么什么三叉戟..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Something something trident."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.74,1:21:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"从瓶子里寻找航海路线"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Look inside the bottle for the charted path."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.88,1:21:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的下一站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our next stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.87,1:21:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(意大利  西西里)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.47,1:23:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开始觉得你其实喜欢这些陆地人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starting to think you actually like these surface-dwellers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.38,1:23:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能看都不看就对一个地方下定论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be wrong to judge a place I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.45,1:23:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上回来  哪里都别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back. Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.07,1:23:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然  就在那座山的顶上有一座旧城堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, apparently, it's just right up on the hill. A big old castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.94,1:23:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚发现了一件非常有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just learned something very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.50,1:23:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.76,1:23:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,匹诺曹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.38,1:23:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我们逃生的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You risked our lives based
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.85,1:23:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是从儿童书里看到的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on something you read in a children's book?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.28,1:23:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  是书里的吗  真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, it's a book? How about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.99,1:24:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从电影里看到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it from the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.89,1:24:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅柔斯国王  我曾希望我们的子民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Nereus, I had hoped our people had evolved
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.35,1:24:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.33,1:24:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再认同那古老的思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beyond that ancient notion
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.50,1:24:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为我们与陆地的战争不可避免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that war with the surface is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.74,1:24:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鱼人的立场是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the position of the Fishermen
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.57,1:24:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要让陆地人知道我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that when the time comes to make ourselves known to the landsmen,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.84,1:24:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那应该是我们去教育他们  而不是毁灭他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it should be to educate them, not to destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.01,1:24:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我钦佩你的雄心壮志  里库国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire your lofty aspirations, King Ricou.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.52,1:24:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I suspect
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.41,1:24:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们其实就只是一群懦夫而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they are but clouds of ink hiding the heart of a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.52,1:24:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,岂有此理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.93,1:24:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  我恳求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. I implore you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.23,1:24:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们国人都是傲慢的哲学家和软弱的诗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a kingdom of bloated philosophers and flaccid poets
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.03,1:24:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的海水污浊不堪  这让我恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose waters have grown stagnant, and it sickens me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.18,1:25:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My King!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.68,1:25:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王已死  他的后嗣万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king is dead! Long live his heir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.19,1:25:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.42,1:25:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让你的军队做好准备  陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare your armies, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.03,1:25:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上进攻咸水族王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We move against the Brine Kingdom at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.04,1:25:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像怎么说的来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did the recording say, again?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.11,1:25:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"前往世界边缘之外的暗海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Journey beyond the edge of the world to the Hidden Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.08,1:25:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从瓶子里寻找航海路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look in the bottle for the charted path.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.59,1:25:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在真正的国王手中  才能真正看到"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in the hands of the true king can he truly see."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.18,1:25:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"从瓶子里寻找航海路线"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Look in the bottle for the charted path."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.29,1:25:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.36,1:25:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.56,1:25:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.93,1:25:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.47,1:25:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要怎么知道往哪个方向看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. But how do you know where to point it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.67,1:25:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.20,1:25:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一句是什么来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the last line?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.91,1:26:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"只有在真正的国王手中  才能真正看到"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Only in the hands of the true king can he truly see."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.38,1:26:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"只有在真正的国王手中..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Only in the hands of the true..."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.58,1:26:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马尔库斯·阿格里帕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus Agrippa.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.71,1:26:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是位伟大的将军  但不是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a great general, but he wasn't a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.55,1:26:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大西庇阿也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither was Scipio.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.35,1:26:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些东西你是怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.02,1:26:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我老爸  他把我的历史都教给我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of my pops. He made sure I knew my history.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.12,1:26:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人都不是国王  除了这个家伙  罗慕路斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of these guys are kings, except this guy. Romulus.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.43,1:26:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马首任国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First king of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.53,1:26:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"只有在真正的国王手中  才能真正看到"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Only in the hands of the true king can he truly see."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.68,1:26:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了  那就是我们的目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. That's our heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.68,1:26:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.02,1:26:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个低能儿还不赖吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not bad for an imbecile, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.26,1:26:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.48,1:27:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.61,1:27:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"厌恶在深处等待并渴望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Loathsomeness waits and dreams in the deep,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.45,1:27:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腐朽遍布于人那摇摇欲坠的城市"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and decay spreads over the tottering cities of men."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.43,1:27:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.10,1:27:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.17,1:27:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你们退下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I order you to stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.88,1:27:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉公主  你被指控以叛国罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Princess Mera, you've been charged with high treason.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.40,1:28:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.73,1:28:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个或许能唤起你的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this will jog your memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.81,1:28:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是潜艇上那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the guy from the sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.98,1:28:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.79,1:29:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在我有亚特兰蒂斯钢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I have Atlantean steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.86,1:29:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我"黑蝠鲼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me "Black Manta."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.91,1:29:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能逃得了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you could walk away?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.99,1:29:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是告诉过你不要把这当成习惯吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I told you not to make this a habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.51,1:29:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.61,1:30:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要血债血偿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.88,1:30:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.55,1:30:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这位女伴有几个想要盯住她的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lady friend has people who like to keep tabs on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.17,1:30:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.56,1:31:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.16,1:32:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.80,1:32:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都进去  进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, inside. Get inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.74,1:32:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会像你那么"仁慈"对待我父亲一样对待你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you the same mercy you showed my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.85,1:32:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你像剖鱼一样剖开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And gut you like the fish you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.90,1:33:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(系统故障)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.86,1:34:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.04,1:34:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉  他们在追踪你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera, they're tracking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.54,1:34:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.67,1:34:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在追踪你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're tracking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.22,1:34:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟  坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.06,1:34:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟  醒醒  亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur, wake up! Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.68,1:35:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你偷了一艘船吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you steal a boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.31,1:35:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,码头的船不是公用的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are the boats at the marina not for public use?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.45,1:35:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  那是个人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, those belong to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.19,1:35:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人是奥姆的精锐先锋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those were Orm's elite commandos.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.92,1:35:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是带头的人  不是亚特兰蒂斯人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the one who led them, he wasn't Atlantean.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.23,1:35:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前从没见过他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.60,1:35:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.26,1:35:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和他父亲是海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and his father were pirates.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.23,1:36:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把他父亲的死怪在我头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he blames me for his father's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.80,1:36:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们选择了一个危险的行业  不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They picked a dangerous line of trade. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.21,1:36:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但感觉不是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.18,1:36:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我能决定他的生死  而我让他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was up to me, and I let him die.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.15,1:36:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本可以救他  但我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could've saved him, but I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.05,1:36:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我树敌了  他差点就伤到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I made an enemy, and he could have hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.02,1:36:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤到你的话就是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that would have been my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.43,1:36:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在是过去时了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's behind us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.76,1:36:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该担心的是后面的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what lies ahead that should concern us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.97,1:36:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航海路线带我们去的是海沟国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The charted path leads to the Kingdom of the Trench.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.94,1:36:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他们杀害了我母亲  对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those the same creatures that killed my mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.01,1:36:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.38,1:36:44.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她被带去那里祭献给了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was taken there and sacrificed to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.48,1:36:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里已经变成了死亡之地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's become a place of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.65,1:36:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们对那里有什么几乎一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know next to nothing about what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.99,1:36:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should turn back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.22,1:36:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们仍然有时间警告陆地人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still warn the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.44,1:36:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们做好准备  迎接即将到来的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and prepare them for what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.03,1:36:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn back?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.63,1:37:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从小就学会了不显露弱点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I learned from a young age not to show weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.67,1:37:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  我用愤怒和拳头解决我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? I solve my problems with my anger and my fists.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.90,1:37:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是个粗人  我擅长武力解决问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a blunt instrument, and I'm damn good at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.91,1:37:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这一路下来  我就只有被揍的份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've done nothing but get my ass kicked this whole trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.38,1:37:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是领袖  不是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no leader. I'm not a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.41,1:37:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不擅长跟别人合作或者相处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not work or play well with others.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.15,1:37:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能让你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't let you die
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.72,1:37:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为想把我变成我本就不是的那种人而死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to turn me into something that I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.85,1:37:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得因为你是两个不同世界之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're unworthy to lead
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.49,1:37:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结合所生  所以你不配当领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're of two different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.56,1:37:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其实正因为如此  你才配{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that is exactly why you are worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.70,1:37:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是陆地和海洋之间的桥梁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the bridge between land and sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.79,1:37:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.27,1:37:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only question is...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.51,1:37:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能做到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.96,1:38:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前还未能追踪到媚拉公主  陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tracking on Lady Mera is still dark, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.79,1:38:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.03,1:38:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我值得信赖的宰相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My trusted vizier
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.90,1:38:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我父亲坐上王位起  就一直陪伴左右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has stood by the throne since my father sat upon it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.64,1:38:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争即将打响  你有什么建议给我吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you any advice for me as this war begins?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.54,1:38:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经给你了  国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have already given it, My King.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.68,1:38:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我会一如既往地拥护你的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will stand by your decision, as always.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.81,1:38:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.32,1:38:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To protect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.12,1:38:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时又背叛它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you betray it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.66,1:38:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道你的叛国行径吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I do not know of your treachery?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.19,1:38:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仍效忠于我母亲的私生子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you have remained loyal to my mother's bastard son.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.95,1:38:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用了多年时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you have spent years
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.08,1:38:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来训练他夺走我的王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}training him to take the throne from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.94,1:38:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要否认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not deny it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.75,1:38:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.48,1:39:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.25,1:39:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是血统纯正的继承人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the pureblood.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.12,1:39:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将毕生都献给了亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have devoted my life to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.16,1:39:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本不想与之有任何关系  你发誓效忠国王的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted nothing to do with it. You swore to serve the throne!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.66,1:39:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我确实效忠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do serve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.66,1:39:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟虽然只是半个亚特兰蒂斯人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur may only be half-Atlantean,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.33,1:39:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他已经比你这个国王够格两倍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's already twice the king you'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.77,1:39:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.44,1:39:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是要确保他能看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But make sure he has a view.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.54,1:41:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些到底是什么鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.18,1:41:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海沟族  我们到目的地了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Trench! We're here!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.55,1:41:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们太多了  - 快进里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are too many of them! -  Come on, inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.96,1:41:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是从深海来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're from the depths.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.03,1:41:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们害怕光  给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're scared of the light. Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.04,1:41:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.15,1:41:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好跳了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready to jump?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.42,1:43:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.54,1:43:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(海沟族)
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.69,1:43:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会把我们撕碎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing will tear us apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.69,1:43:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们别无选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.45,1:44:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.42,1:44:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.85,1:44:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.05,1:44:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.05,1:44:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(地心  暗海)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.71,1:45:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.91,1:45:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媚拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mera!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.16,1:45:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.23,1:45:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.80,1:46:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧瓦克国王把我祭献给海沟族  但我活下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King Orvax sacrificed me to the Trench, but I survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.54,1:46:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你一样一路奋战  最后到了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought my way through as you did, and I ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.01,1:46:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人在这里待了20年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been here alone for 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.84,1:46:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.31,1:46:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  在这里坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Sit here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.72,1:46:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.32,1:46:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我让这一切发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.96,1:47:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都是因为你生了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This happened because you had me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.46,1:47:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为生了你  没什么是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for having you. None of this is your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.33,1:47:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我做出了选择  我必须离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a choice. I had to leave...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.23,1:47:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才能救你  才能救你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save you, to save your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.74,1:47:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  告诉我他的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me. Tell me about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.74,1:47:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.91,1:47:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还是会走到那个码头尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still walks to the end of that dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.22,1:47:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天早上都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.29,1:47:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.86,1:47:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.97,1:47:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you ever come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.04,1:47:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为带你来这里的传送门不让我们回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the portal that brought you here won't let us return.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.28,1:47:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三叉戟是回去的唯一方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trident is the only way back.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.92,1:48:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是卡拉森在守护着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is guarded by the Karathen.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.16,1:48:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的怪物  是真实存在的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creature from our legends, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.73,1:48:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就在瀑布后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lies beyond the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.93,1:48:18.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们跟你一起去  我们可以一起战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go with you. We can fight it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.27,1:48:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.64,1:48:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它太强大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.47,1:48:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年来我试过很多次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tried many times over the years.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.31,1:48:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只会允许真正的国王通过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creature will only allow the true king to pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.81,1:48:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.22,1:48:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.79,1:48:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.62,1:48:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.29,1:48:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯一直都有国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis has always had a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.93,1:48:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在它需要的不止如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it needs something more.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.13,1:48:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有什么比国王更伟大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what could be greater than a king?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.77,1:48:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.81,1:48:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王只为自己的国家而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A king fights only for his nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.98,1:49:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你为每个人而战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fight for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.80,1:50:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不属于这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not belong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.57,1:50:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have guarded the trident
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.16,1:50:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就守护三叉戟  击退伪王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against false kings since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.15,1:50:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千年来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for a thousand years
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.67,1:50:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见证了最伟大的斗士来尝试并失败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen the greatest champions try and fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.35,1:50:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我从未感知到任何像你一样不够格的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But never have I sensed one as unworthy as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.89,1:51:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个混血杂种  竟敢来此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare come here with your tainted mongrel blood
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.13,1:51:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妄图拿到亚特兰蒂斯最伟大的宝藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to claim Atlantis' greatest treasure?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.97,1:51:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.61,1:51:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混血种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half-breed.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.86,1:51:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为自己有资格吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought yourself worthy?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.07,1:51:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为自己是国王吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought yourself a king?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.20,1:51:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来此就是让此地蒙羞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dishonor this place with your presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.61,1:51:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.28,1:51:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对  我是个混血杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I am a half-breed mongrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.95,1:52:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我来此不是因为我觉得自己有资格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I did not come here because I thought I was worthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.89,1:52:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.79,1:52:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你理解我的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.86,1:52:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.63,1:52:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰王去世后  就没人再能与我沟通了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No mortal has conversed with me since King Atlan.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.54,1:52:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.54,1:52:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个无名小卒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.21,1:52:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这里是因为我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came because I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.55,1:52:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来是为了救我的家园和我爱的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to save my home and the people that I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.26,1:52:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来是因为三叉戟是他们唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came because the trident is their only hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.36,1:52:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这个理由还不够的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if that's not good enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.00,1:52:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就去死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then screw you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.50,1:52:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人成功把三叉戟从亚特兰王的手中拿走过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man has ever freed the trident from Atlan's grip.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.38,1:52:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他认为你没资格...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should he deem you unworthy...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.58,1:53:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我很久没有吃过东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I haven't feasted in eons,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.95,1:53:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在饿极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am famished.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.05,1:54:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one true king.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.56,1:54:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  咸水族是强大的野蛮之族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, the Brine are powerful, savage brutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.53,1:54:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是快速直接地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a swift assault aimed
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.25,1:55:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击他们的领袖  可以扭转局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}directly at their leadership will turn the tide.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.24,1:55:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打败咸水族国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defeat the Brine King,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.07,1:55:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就能拥有这个星球上最强大的军队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will command the greatest military might on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.61,1:55:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天  我们联合我们的王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, we unite our kingdoms.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.28,1:55:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天  我们将陆地夷为平地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, we scorch the surface!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.18,1:55:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崛起吧  亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise, Atlantis!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.24,1:55:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.24,1:55:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消灭亚特兰蒂斯那群丑鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death to the Atlantean hagfish!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.88,1:55:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝不向亚特兰蒂斯屈膝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will not bow to Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.18,1:55:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们给他们一仗  让他们永生难忘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna give them a fight that they will never forget!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.15,1:57:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我们需要他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! We need him!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.16,1:57:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺者昌  逆者亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join me or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.76,1:57:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我称你为陛下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect me to address you as Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.33,1:57:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是"陛下"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.76,1:57:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.03,1:57:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海洋领主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ocean Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.74,1:57:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管把我的军队带走吧  你个软腹鼻涕虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take my army, you soft-bellied slug.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.64,1:57:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你休想让我对你效忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you will never have my allegiance!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.21,1:57:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.34,1:57:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.98,1:58:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的国王崛起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king has risen.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.32,1:58:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进攻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.24,2:00:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤亡太多了  我们必须马上停止战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are too many casualties. We have to stop the fighting now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.94,2:00:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会找到我父亲  但你必须打败奥姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find my father. But you must defeat Orm.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.61,2:00:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我无法打败他呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what if I can't?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.18,2:00:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次是他占尽天时地利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, he was in his element.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.42,2:00:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次  让他尝尝你拥有天时地利时的厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time, make him fight in yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.49,2:01:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 计划是什么来着  - 计划是不要被杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was the plan, again? -  The plan is to not get killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.86,2:01:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好计划  别被杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, good plan. Don't get killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.52,2:02:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海沟族  他号令了海沟族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Trench! He commands the Trench!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.56,2:02:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.91,2:02:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下  让她通过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down! Let her pass.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.65,2:02:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲  求你了  他有三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Father, he has the trident.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.85,2:02:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你认为这场战争没必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you think this war is necessary,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.22,2:02:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但按照我们最神圣的法典  亚瑟是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Arthur is king by our most sacred law.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.79,2:02:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你现在无视那一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you turn your back on that now,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.46,2:02:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你守卫的亚特兰蒂斯就已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then the Atlantis you're fighting for is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.76,2:02:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.89,2:02:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个杂种挥着亚特兰王的三叉戟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The half-breed wields King Atlan's trident.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.83,2:02:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他号令了大海{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He commands the sea!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.16,2:02:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那那个混血种就是你们的国王了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that half-breed is your king.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.38,2:04:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科  快来  他需要我们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko! Come on, he needs our help!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.88,2:04:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能去  你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't! Look.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.78,2:04:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人民必须亲眼见证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people must bear witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.56,2:04:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那把三叉戟不会改变你的出身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That trident doesn't change what you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.92,2:04:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个混血杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A half-breed bastard.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.06,2:04:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯永远不会接受你成为其国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atlantis will never accept you as its king.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.10,2:04:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那浴血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then by bloodshed...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.71,2:04:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方能明神意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do the gods make known their will.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.17,2:05:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交出王位  交出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yield the throne. Yield it!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.30,2:06:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了结吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.50,2:06:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交出王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yield the throne.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.87,2:06:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从不仁慈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mercy is not our way.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.24,2:06:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能没注意到  弟弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you haven't noticed, brother...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.85,2:07:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不是你们的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not one of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.72,2:07:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.19,2:07:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀了我  - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill me! -  No!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.83,2:07:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀戮已经够多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is enough killing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.00,2:07:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.90,2:07:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my son.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.71,2:07:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来话长了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.85,2:07:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我晚点再告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell ya later.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.35,2:07:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.16,2:07:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白  我们以为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. We thought...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.33,2:07:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.90,2:07:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚瑟救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arthur saved me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.40,2:07:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你支持他  - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're with him? -  I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.24,2:08:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是我的孩子  我非常爱你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're both my children, and I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.34,2:08:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你被误导了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have been misguided.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.95,2:08:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲教你说有两个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father taught you that there were two worlds.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.02,2:08:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.89,2:08:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陆地和海洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The land and the sea
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.93,2:08:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一体的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are one.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.45,2:08:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的王后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My queen.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.68,2:08:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vulko.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.35,2:08:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.16,2:08:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但确保他能看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But make sure he has a view.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.50,2:08:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're ready,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.90,2:09:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们聊聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.95,2:09:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯人民  今天以流血开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People of Atlantis, today began in bloodshed,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.09,2:09:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们以喜悦结束吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but let it end in joy.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.06,2:09:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为大家介绍亚特兰蒂斯亚瑟国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you King Arthur of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.60,2:09:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail to the king!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.30,2:09:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 国王万岁  - 国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hail to the king! -  Hail to the king!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.38,2:09:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.31,2:09:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他们的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be their king.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.68,2:09:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定会很好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.80,2:10:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了  你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back. You're back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.71,2:10:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.68,2:10:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲是个灯塔管理员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was a lighthouse keeper.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.39,2:11:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我母亲是个王后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother was a queen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.96,2:11:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不该相识...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were never meant to meet...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.23,2:11:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们的爱拯救了世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But their love saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.83,2:11:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们造就了今天的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.43,2:11:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陆地人的儿子  海洋的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A son of the land, and a king of the seas.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.71,2:11:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是深海的保护者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the protector of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.54,2:11:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:26.28,2:11:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aquaman.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.65,2:14:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.44,2:14:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有15年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent 15 years
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.98,2:14:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在美国海洋科学研究所...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the United States Institute of Marine Science...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.34,2:14:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是被炒了吗  - 研究海洋事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weren't you fired? -  ...studying oceanic phenomenon,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.51,2:14:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是目前为止最确凿的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is the most conclusive evidence we have to date.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.88,2:14:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深海地震仪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep-sea seismographs
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.04,2:14:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记录到了海洋底部的爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have recorded explosions on the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.45,2:14:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有卫星影像显示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have satellite imagery
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.66,2:15:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚特兰蒂斯战舰碎片漂浮在海面...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of debris from Atlantean warships floating on the surface...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.02,2:15:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 沈博士  - 你能让我说完吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Shin! -  Will you please let me finish?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.83,2:15:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来了  亚特兰蒂斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go again. Atlantean?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.06,2:15:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  政府不想让我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. The government does not want us to know
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.83,2:15:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当前存在的威胁...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the threat that exists right here...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.40,2:15:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不建议你那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.98,2:15:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是亚特兰蒂斯人的技术  是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Atlantean technology, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.92,2:15:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能告诉我你怎么得到这个的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell me how you got this?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.05,2:15:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以  但首先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. But first,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.42,2:15:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得告诉我怎么找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you gotta tell me how to find him.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.60,2:15:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(谁是海王)
